  - mathlib4
  - formal-verification
  - number-theory
abstract: >-
  Axiom-free Lean 4.35.0 formalizations of classical equivalences and unconditional
  theorems surrounding the Riemann zeta function (Littlewood, von Koch, Nyman-Beurling,
  de la Vallee Poussin, Hardy, Vasyunin-Baez-Duarte, and 64 self-contained,
  linter-verified modular Lean 4 formalization units, updated from 57, 58, 59, 60, 61, 62, and 63). Conditional equivalences parameterize their analytic hypotheses explicitly (MSC 2020 11M26, 46E20, 68V20).
